<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3014] NPE when the query runs successfully with empty result set and error message refinement</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3014</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When the sql query runs successfully, with empty result set, e.g. a select query with zero rows returned, there would be NPE issue.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;On the other hand, when the query fails, current kylin interpreter does not expose the detailed error message the kylin server returns, need refine this error message for better readability.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
